# Approximation of Jolla's en.qml letter rows for PC tests: <offset> <key width> <keys>.
# Units are key widths of a 10-key row; rows are one unit apart. The handler
# reads the real geometry from the layout on the phone.
0    1 qwertyuiop
0.5  1 asdfghjkl
1.5  1 zxcvbnm
